<#f0f000>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Zanjan Avantura_EX						_QDB^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A powerful gut punch.
   A Version is fast.
   B Version is slow and high damage. 
      Can be held to draw the opponent in
      and can be feinted with D.
   C Version is fast and high damage.</>
Starlight Slaughter Lamb_EX							_CHARGE_B_F^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A sliding kick with the ability to go under many attacks.
   A version is fast. 
   B version is slower and more active. 
   EX is fast, multi-hitting, and ends in an air raid launcher.</>
Moonlight Slaughter Lamb_EX_AIR							_CHARGE_B_F^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A rapid divekick that must be blocked standing.
   A version hits at a shallow angle.
   B version flies more horizontally. [R]
   EX is ken carson goomba. [R] (Midcombo)</>
Water's Edge_EX_AIROK								_QDB^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A series of kick attacks.
   A version is a upward kick that starts combos. Has followups.
   B Version lunges across the screen at high speed. [R]
   EX is an overhead that knocks down air opponents. [R]</>
